ms.html</guid></item><item><title>这些村民想知道他们是否处于俄罗斯影子战争的前线</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/europe/liepzig-airport-drone-attack-russia-ukraine-war.html</link><description>俄罗斯被指控对乌克兰在欧洲的盟友进行秘密袭击，尤其是在德国东部的莱比锡/哈雷机场。这改变了附近村民的生活。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:36:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/europe/liepzig-airport-drone-attack-russia-ukraine-war.html</guid></item><item><title>遭受海上轰炸的厄瓜多尔渔民起诉特朗普政府</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/world/americas/trump-us-boat-strikes-lawsuit-ecuador-fishermen.html</link><description>罢工幸存者提起的第一起诉讼针对的是美国秘密军事行动，该行动已造成 240 多人死亡。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:21:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/world/americas/trump-us-boat-strikes-lawsuit-ecuador-fishermen.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普政府继续推进针对美国律师的法律斗争</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/us/trump-administration-presses-ahead-in-legal-battle-over-us-attorneys.html</link><description>法官裁定比尔·埃萨利 (Bill Essayli) 在洛杉矶担任美国检察官的行为“非法”。他是特朗普政府通过独特程序任命的三名检察官之一。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:06:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/us/trump-administration-presses-ahead-in-legal-battle-over-us-attorneys.html</guid></item><item><title>美国联邦航空局 (FAA) 搁置了与全国地面站相连的路由器等路由器</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/us/faa-routers-ground-stop.html</link><description>联邦官员表示，他们认为瞻博网络制造的路由器导致数据过载，从而中断了通信。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:51:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/us/faa-routers-ground-stop.html</guid></item><item><title>由于入学人数下降，全国范围内的学校正在关闭。父母很生气。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/us/public-schools-closing-birth-rate-enrollment.html</link><description>随着出生婴儿的减少和学校选择的增多，全国各地的学区都得出结论，必须缩小规模。家人正在试图反击。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026